      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you're saying about boundaries but it doesn't change the reality. it's just constant. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to break, and i think it's me. like, if the struggle is just part of who i am because of how the world sees me, is there even a version of life where i'm not just... hurting? it feels like the only way to actually stop the hurting is to just stop existing entirely.",
